# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/mcp-duckduckgo.git
cd mcp-duckduckgo

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Make the script executable
chmod +x app.py

# Run the server
python app.py
```

### Using fastmcp

